---

<section class="team-section" id="team">
  <div class="team-wrap">

    <div class="team-kicker-row">
      <span class="team-kicker-bar"></span>
      <span class="team-kicker-text">The team</span>
    </div>

    <h2 class="team-title">Four directors. One operating principle.</h2>

    <div class="directors-grid">
      <div class="director-card">
        <p class="director-name">Stephen McGurk</p>
        <p class="director-role">DIRECTOR, STRATEGY</p>
        <p class="director-desc">Engagement strategy and the senior relationships that anchor major engagements, with a background across program management, regional development, and the institutional design that holds multilateral arrangements together.</p>
        <span class="director-badge">Cited, WEF 2025 · industrial cluster digitalisation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="director-card">
        <p class="director-name">Ashley Olsson</p>
        <p class="director-role">DIRECTOR, INDUSTRIAL CIRCULARITY</p>
        <p class="director-desc">Analytical methodology and system-level engagements, with a background across industrial symbiosis design, regional system strategy, and the operator-network analysis underneath Khora's flow inventory and cascade work.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="director-card">
        <p class="director-name">David Hicks</p>
        <p class="director-role">DIRECTOR, OPERATIONS</p>
        <p class="director-desc">Operations, financial discipline, and engagement delivery, with a background across complex programme management and the cost-recovery design that keeps the multilateral funding model standing up.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="director-card">
        <p class="director-name">Vinnie Nici</p>
        <p class="director-role">DIRECTOR, TECHNOLOGY</p>
        <p class="director-desc">Khora's architecture and the data infrastructure that keeps the analytical work reproducible, with a background across data architecture and the engineering discipline that turns analysis into an operating engine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="team-kicker-row">
      <span class="team-kicker-bar"></span>
      <span class="team-kicker-text">Advisory board</span>
    </div>

    <h3 class="advisory-title">External counsel on the calls that matter.</h3>
    <p class="advisory-desc">Independent perspective drawn from outside the day to day of engagement delivery, brought in on positioning, technical direction, and the decisions that carry weight beyond a single client.</p>

    <div class="advisory-grid">
      <div class="advisory-card">
        <p class="advisor-name">Jason Crusan</p>
        <p class="advisor-role">Advisory board</p>
        <p class="advisor-desc">Large scale technology governance and program architecture, with a background spanning NASA's Artemis Program and Lunar Gateway architecture through to energy strategy at Woodside and independent technology advisory through Vectyra Ventures.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="advisory-card">
        <p class="advisor-name">Jackie O'Dowd</p>
        <p class="advisor-role">Advisory board</p>
        <p class="advisor-desc">Systems governance and complexity leadership for organisations navigating multiple interdependent parts, with a background founding and leading Realising-Potential and advising government, healthcare, and industrial clients on enterprise architecture, data analytics, and decision visibility.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="advisory-card">
        <p class="advisor-name">Dr Chris Oughton</p>
        <p class="advisor-role">Advisory board</p>
        <p class="advisor-desc">Industrial symbiosis and precinct governance built across 17 years as Chief Executive of the Kwinana Industries Council, with a background coordinating fifty plus co-located industries and developing the KIC4 evaluation model.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.team-section {
  background: #0a0e13;
  padding: 64px 40px;
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  color: #e8e6df;
}

.team-wrap {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.team-kicker-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.team-kicker-bar {
  width: 22px;
  height: 1px;
  background: #1a6b6b;
}

.team-kicker-text {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: #5f9e9e;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.team-title {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 34px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  color: #ffffff;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.directors-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: #23282f;
  border: 1px solid #23282f;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.director-card {
  background: #0a0e13;
  padding: 24px 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.director-name {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  color: #fff;
}

.director-role {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  color: #5f9e9e;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.director-desc {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #9a988f;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.director-badge {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  color: #5f9e9e;
  padding: 3px 8px;
  display: inline-block;
  align-self: flex-start;
  border: 1px solid rgba(95, 158, 158, 0.2);
  border-radius: 2px;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.advisory-title {
  font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 24px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  color: #ffffff;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.advisory-desc {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #9a988f;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 32px;
  max-width: 640px;
}

.advisory-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.advisory-card {
  border: 1px solid #23282f;
  padding: 22px 20px;
  background: #0a0e13;
}

.advisor-name {
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 15px;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
  color: #fff;
}

.advisor-role {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
  color: #b8903a;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.advisor-desc {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: #9a988f;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
}

/* Responsive Media Queries */
@media (max-width: 980px) {
  .team-section {
    padding: 48px 24px;
  }
  .directors-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
  .advisory-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .team-section {
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }
  .directors-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .advisory-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
